        "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You play as Ogie the frog in this platformer where you must use your jump strength precisely to navigate each level. Along with reaching the finish line, each level has its own objectives, including rescuing baby animals, and collecting mysterious gems. Ogie doesn't like the water, or skunks, so be sure to avoid them. But he likes jumping, croaking, and catching dragonflies. Master his jumps and complete perfect runs to gain rare achievements, save critters, and more in og frog fr.</p>",
